+    /// Everything fnmatch cannot answer with native ops keeps the helper:
+    /// bracket classes, extglob, a third star, a dynamic pattern, the
+    /// helper's own def line — and a subject whose args do not close on
+    /// the line (the `$( uname )` dispatch renders multi-line).
